    "created_at": "2018-05-11T10:52:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-11T10:52:59Z",
    "body": "The original spec was talking about \"empty control group\", such as a `<dialog>` without any focusable element in it.  But as the result that we removed `<dialog>`-specific behavior that the original spec intended, dumb replacement of \"control group\" to \"document\" made such conditions.\r\nI'll take closer look to find out inconsistency.\r\n\r\n@annevk I don't understand your comment.  Could you elaborate?",
